# Auth (Google SAML + cookie session) endpoints
# Default port 5009 is for local `dotnet run` (launchSettings.json).
# Docker Compose uses port 5000 -- change @baseUrl if running via `make dev`.
#
# In Development, use /auth/stub-login (below) to drive the full sign-in pipeline without a live
# Google IdP -- real SAML needs the registered ACS hostname. Outside Development stub-login 404s.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5009

### Session probe -- identity + privileges for the current cookie session (401 when signed out)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me
Accept: application/json

### Initiate the Google SAML challenge (302 to Google; 503 when SAML not configured)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/login?returnUrl=/timesheet/week

### Development-only stub login -- drives the same CompleteSignIn pipeline (SuperAdmin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/stub-login?email=avery.quinn@example.com&groups=Timesheet-SuperAdmin-dev&name=Avery Quinn

### Development-only stub login -- baseline user (EDJEr only, no mapped groups)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/stub-login?email=alice@leadingedje.com

### Log out -- clears the session cookie and lands on the signed-out page
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout

### Signed-out landing page (anonymous, text/plain)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/signed-out

### Access-denied page (403 with reason)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/access-denied?msg=No Matching Person Record
